.SH HISTORY
fail2zig 0.1.0 was the first public release, April 2026.
fail2zig 0.3.0 was released September 2026.
fail2zig 0.4.7 was released October 2026 with runtime ignore entries, a
truncation policy per jail and the batched stop.
fail2zig 0.4.8 was released October 2026 with one shared 65,536-ban pool,
